sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer / CI
    participant CLI as bolalens scan
    participant L as WorkspaceLoader
    participant S as SymbolicPipeline
    participant W as PathWalker
    participant C as SymbolicClassifier
    participant IR as IrSliceGenerator
    participant V as ISemanticValidator
    participant F as FusionPolicy
    participant R as JsonReportWriter
    Dev->>CLI: scan BolaLab.sln --mode hybrid
    CLI->>L: LoadAsync(path)
    L-->>CLI: Solution + load diagnostics
    CLI->>S: RunAsync(solution)
    S->>S: endpoints, policy map, ownership schema, DI map
    loop each endpoint × id parameter
        S->>W: Walk(endpoint, source)
        W-->>S: steps, sinks, guard candidates, unresolved
        S->>C: Classify(path)
        C-->>S: SymbolicVerdict + rule IDs
    end
    loop each candidate (Vulnerable / Unknown / SYM-05)
        CLI->>IR: Generate(path)
        IR-->>CLI: label-free slice
        CLI->>V: ValidateAsync(slice, prompt)
        V-->>CLI: SemanticVerdict (parsed, grounded)
        CLI->>F: Fuse(symbolic, semantic)
    end
    CLI->>R: report.json
    CLI-->>Dev: console summary + exit code (1 if Vulnerable)
